    {
      "subId": "4003904",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Beidou",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400390401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400390401": {
            "id": "400390401",
            "speakerId": 1031,
            "speakerName": "Beidou",
            "text": "Ugh, Ningguang... you're really trying my patience...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390402"
            ]
          },
          "400390402": {
            "id": "400390402",
            "speakerId": 1031,
            "speakerName": "Beidou",
            "text": "I'm sorry, but if the Jade Chamber smashed into smithereens when it hit the sea, then so did everything inside it. Just because I know the ocean doesn't mean I have the power to fish up the past...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390403"
            ]
          },
          "400390403": {
            "id": "400390403",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...The salvaging is going pretty smoothly, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390404"
            ]
          },
          "400390404": {
            "id": "400390404",
            "speakerId": 1031,
            "speakerName": "Beidou",
            "text": "Oh, Traveler. What're you doing out this way?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390405"
            ]
          },
          "400390405": {
            "id": "400390405",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm here to help out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390406"
            ]
          },
          "400390406": {
            "id": "400390406",
            "speakerId": 1031,
            "speakerName": "Beidou",
            "text": "Great! You couldn't have picked a better time. The whole fleet's caught up with other things right now, so I'll take all the help I can get.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390407"
            ]
          },
          "400390407": {
            "id": "400390407",
            "speakerId": 1031,
            "speakerName": "Beidou",
            "text": "Look, I even had to rope Xinyan into this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390408"
            ]
          },
          "400390408": {
            "id": "400390408",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Whoa, Xinyan's here!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390409"
            ]
          },
          "400390409": {
            "id": "400390409",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, what's the occasion? Did you come all the way out here to do a performance?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390410"
            ]
          },
          "400390410": {
            "id": "400390410",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "You bet I did! Nothing official, mind you. Beidou wanted to hold a feast onboard and I agreed to come play a couple o' tunes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390411"
            ]
          },
          "400390411": {
            "id": "400390411",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "But all that went out the window when someone showed up saying they were one of Ningguang's secretaries. They called Beidou away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390412"
            ]
          },
          "400390412": {
            "id": "400390412",
            "speakerId": 1031,
            "speakerName": "Beidou",
            "text": "I think it was Baiwen, or Baixiao...? Ugh, well it was Bai-something.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390413"
            ]
          },
          "400390413": {
            "id": "400390413",
            "speakerId": 1031,
            "speakerName": "Beidou",
            "text": "Anyway. Ningguang apparently came up with the bright idea of me going out on the sea and salvaging a bunch of her old valuables. She seems pretty willing to shell out for it, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390414"
            ]
          },
          "400390414": {
            "id": "400390414",
            "speakerId": 1031,
            "speakerName": "Beidou",
            "text": "Hmph... Well, at the end of the day, the price was right. So yeah, we took the work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390415"
            ]
          },
          "400390415": {
            "id": "400390415",
            "speakerId": 1031,
            "speakerName": "Beidou",
            "text": "Now, if we're gonna go trawling for trinkets, we're gonna need a smaller vessel.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390416"
            ]
          },
          "400390416": {
            "id": "400390416",
            "speakerId": 1031,
            "speakerName": "Beidou",
            "text": "All the available boats have been dispatched already. But by the looks of it, we're still one short...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390417"
            ]
          },
          "400390417": {
            "id": "400390417",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I have my own boat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390418"
            ]
          },
          "400390418": {
            "id": "400390418",
            "speakerId": 1031,
            "speakerName": "Beidou",
            "text": "So you have your own vessel do ya? Hah! Great, let's take yours, then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400390419"
            ]
          },
          "400390419": {
            "id": "400390419",
            "speakerId": 1031,
            "speakerName": "Beidou",
            "text": "The more people we have on this job the better. 'Cause the sooner we get this wrapped up, the sooner we can get that feast going and actually enjoy the festival!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
